  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Alcohol Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A creamy, high-pigment, non-drying matte liner for lips, eyes, and cheeks to create infinite looks.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating, Long-wearing</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>-Shea Butter: Hydrates and soothes skin.</p><p>-Marula Oil: A rich antioxidant to moisturize and soften skin.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-The only rule is, there are no rules! Swipe on lips, eyes, cheeks, or anywhere else on the face.<br></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Shea Butter: Hydrates and soothes skin.<br>-Marula Oil: A rich antioxidant to moisturize and soften skin.<br><br>Hydrogenated Jojoba Oil, Mica, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Canola Oil/Canola/Huile de colza, Sclerocarya Birrea Seed Oil, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax/Candelilla Cera/Cire de candelilla, Glyceryl Caprylate, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Cera Carnauba/Cire de carnauba, Tocopherol, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Ascorbyl Palmitate, May Contain (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Manganese Violet (CI 77742), Red 40 Lake (CI 16035).<br><br>.<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
